{"abstract":"The area of cyberinfrastructures has looked extensively at research within the natural sciences, however, the social sciences have been largely overlooked in terms of novel data collection and analysis systems. We developed a probe tool, TagPad, to look at the process for social science data collection through interviews and surveys. Our research participants found that TagPad facilitated structuring of interviews but we also found that the setting in which the interview takes place is essential to the success of using this particular tool. We conclude suggesting future designs of social science research tools.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bornoe, Nis","Barkhuus, Louise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-071467"],"event":{"acronym":"iConference","end":"2013-07-15","place":"Forth Worth, TX, us","start":"2013-02-12","title":"iConference 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Stockholm University"],"keyword":["Qualitative Research","Social science","e science"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tagpad supporting field interviews and analysis","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.9776/13204","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-071467","ids":["aau-49d51133-9b7f-4a2a-b827-d33ea8da9297"],"keyword":["cyberinfrastuctures","e-research","e-science","qualitative research","social science"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B85D818BB91F0D65202F4055895A21F6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ideals.illinois.edu/bitstream/handle/2142/36043/204.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.9776/13204","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Information Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Computer Science, Research Centre for Socio-Interactive Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"stockholm university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Stockholm University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Nis","key":"bornoepau","last":"Bornoe","locid":"5d796fd0-3a6d-47da-ace0-b96e1f4aa402","name":"Bornoe, Nis","orcid":"0000-0003-4624-8143","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise","key":"barkhuuspau","last":"Barkhuus","name":"Barkhuus, Louise","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.9776/13204","pages":"316-325","publisher":"iSchools","status":"p","title":"iConference 2013 papers"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-49d51133-9b7f-4a2a-b827-d33ea8da9297"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"TagPad : Supporting Field Interviews and Analysis","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-071467","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
